### QA-22 — Проверяем завершение Recovery
### Запускать после того, как отмена старше 2 минут
### и планировщик Recovery выполнил очередной проход.
### Ожидаем 200 CANCELLED

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{qaFailureBookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
    client.test("QA-22: Recovery completed", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200);
        client.assert(response.body.status === "CANCELLED",
            "Expected CANCELLED, got " + response.body.status);
    });
%}


### QA-23 — Проверяем счётчик после Recovery
### Ожидаем 200, timesBooked = 3

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{qaRoomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
    client.test("QA-23: History preserved", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200);
        client.assert(Number(response.body.timesBooked) === 1,
            "Expected 3, got " + response.body.timesBooked);
    });
%}


### QA-24 — Бронируем освобождённые Recovery даты
### Ожидаем 201 CONFIRMED

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": {{qaRoomId}},
  "checkIn": "{{qaFailureCheckIn}}",
  "checkOut": "{{qaFailureCheckOut}}",
  "guestCount": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("QA-24: Recovered room available", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201);
        client.assert(response.body.status === "CONFIRMED");
    });
%}


